      "ASSISTANT: How was your weekend?\nNAOMI: Fine, thanks Gloria.\nERIN: San Fran good?\nNAOMI: You read up on the companies? Which one stands out?",
      "SAM: Naomi Bishop?\nNAOMI: Samantha Ryan.\nSAM: I thought you hated alumni events!\nNAOMI: Well, you know. Important to give back. Especially to mentor the--",
      "ERIN: New specs.\nNAOMI: Terrific.\nERIN: Is there anything else you need?\nNAOMI: I need my team to stay awake for the pitch tomorrow. Go on, get some rest.",
      "NAOMI: When I was a kid, if you wanted privacy, if you wanted to send a secret message, you made invisible ink with vinegar.\nNAOMI: And when you were ready to “go public” you revealed your message with grape juice.\nERIN: But Cachet has certainly taken privacy to the next level, and we are so pleased to have the chance to foster that growth. If you open your b…",
      "ERIN: Hi, sorry--\nNAOMI: Thanks."
    ]
